#: ../../source/templates_runwayml.md:16
msgid "1. Visual Theme & Atmosphere"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_runwayml.md:18
msgid ""
"Runway's interface is a cinematic reel brought to life as a website — a "
"dark, editorial, film-production-grade design where full-bleed "
"photography and video ARE the primary UI elements. This is not a typical "
"tech product page; it's a visual manifesto for AI-powered creativity. "
"Every section feels like a frame from a film: dramatic lighting, sweeping"
" landscapes, and intimate human moments captured in high-quality imagery "
"that dominates the viewport."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_runwayml.md:20
msgid ""
"The design language is built on a single typeface — abcNormal — a clean, "
"geometric sans-serif that handles everything from 48px display headlines "
"to 11px uppercase labels. This single-font commitment creates an extreme "
"typographic uniformity that lets the visual content speak louder than the"
" text. Headlines use tight line-heights (1.0) with negative letter-"
"spacing (-0.9px to -1.2px), creating compressed text blocks that feel "
"like film titles rather than marketing copy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_runwayml.md:22
msgid ""
"What makes Runway distinctive is its complete commitment to visual "
"content as design. Rather than illustrating features with icons or "
"diagrams, Runway shows actual AI-generated and AI-enhanced imagery — cars"
" driving through cinematic landscapes, artistic portraits, architectural "
"renders. The interface itself retreats into near-invisibility: minimal "
"borders, zero shadows, subtle cool-gray text, and a dark palette that "
"puts maximum focus on the photography."
msgstr ""

