"labels"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_runwayml.md:27
msgid "Dark-dominant palette with cool-toned neutrals (#767d88, #7d848e)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_runwayml.md:28
msgid "Zero shadows, minimal borders — the interface is intentionally invisible"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_runwayml.md:29
msgid ""
"Tight display typography (line-height 1.0) with negative tracking (-0.9px"
" to -1.2px)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_runwayml.md:30
msgid "Uppercase labels with positive letter-spacing for navigational structure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_runwayml.md:31
msgid ""
"Weight 450 (unusual intermediate) for small uppercase text — precision "
"craft"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_runwayml.md:32
