"production design decision — in cinema, depth comes from lighting, focus,"
" and composition, not drop shadows. The interface mirrors this "
"philosophy: depth is communicated through dark/light section alternation,"
" photographic depth-of-field, and overlay transparency — never through "
"CSS box-shadow."
